code:
razani_civil_war_5_desc: "Noble Shanuzushanuz, important news comes from the east! An army serving the #E Nazani#! emperor has landed in the east, claiming the #E Eastern Throne#!!

#![GetCharacter('(int32)326').GetFirstName]#!' forces have landed at the port of [GetProvince('(int32)2348').GetName] and has taken control of the surrounding region. With [GetProvince('(int32)2306').GetName] under his control, he now threatens the highland cities of the friendly #E Gunstris#!, which would be a great loss for us.

If these reports are true, then the armies of the [GetCountry('WGA').GetName] will stop at nothing to reclaim the east for themselves. The only hope for the #E Emperor of the East#! is to defeat the armies of the #E Purple Emperor#! before he's able to ship over more of his forces across the mighty #E Intergealian Sea#!!"
